-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LoCoMo dataset
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT contain or redistribute the LoCoMo dataset. The scripts
here download it from its authors' repository, verify it, and use it locally:

  https://github.com/snap-research/locomo  (data/locomo10.json)

LoCoMo is licensed by its authors under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0), as stated in
that repository's LICENSE.txt. The download script saves a copy of that licence
beside the dataset. Your use of the dataset is governed by its licence, not by
this repository's.

Results committed under results/ contain question identifiers, category labels,
verdicts and the benchmarked system's own answers. They contain no question
text, gold answers or conversation text from the dataset.

LoCoMo was introduced in:

  Adyasha Maharana, Dong-Ho Lee, Sergey Tulyakov, Mohit Bansal,
  Francesco Barbieri, Yuwei Fang. "Evaluating Very Long-Term Conversational
  Memory of LLM Agents." ACL 2024. arXiv:2402.17753.

  @article{maharana2024evaluating,
    title={Evaluating very long-term conversational memory of llm agents},
    author={Maharana, Adyasha and Lee, Dong-Ho and Tulyakov, Sergey and Bansal, Mohit and Barbieri, Francesco and Fang, Yuwei},
    journal={arXiv preprint arXiv:2402.17753},
    year={2024}
  }

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Engraphy
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The benchmark harness runs from a checkout of the Engraphy engine, fetched from
https://github.com/devon-clarkk/engraphy at the commit pinned in
config/locomo.json. The engine is licensed separately under the Business Source
License 1.1; it is not included in this repository.
